{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36337","headline":"题法华寺绝顶禅家壁 · 方干","name":"题法华寺绝顶禅家壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苍翠迢嶤逼窅冥，下方雷雨上方晴。\n飞流便向砌边挂，片月影从窗外行。\n驯鹿不知谁结侣，野禽都是自呼名。\n只应禅者无来去，坐看千山白发生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}